About Baringa&nbsp;

Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.

The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence - all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.

Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly - all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.

Certified as a&nbsp; Great Place to Work around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the Financial Times in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by Forbes for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.

Our Products &amp; Services practice are looking for Summer Interns to join the team.

What you will be doing

You will be part of a team bringing Baringa's global capabilities to our clients in the US Products and Services sector. We work with clients across&nbsp;CP&amp;R (Consumer Products&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Retail)&nbsp;and TMT (Technology,&nbsp;Media&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Telecommunications)&nbsp;to help solve some of their toughest challenges around AI-centric transformation, infrastructure optimization, supply chain agility, and&nbsp;commercial&nbsp;growth&nbsp;strategy.&nbsp; &nbsp;

Based in Baringa's New York office, you'll work with our team of industry experts who come from a blend of traditional consulting and hands-on industry experience in a client-facing project role where you can demonstrate your ability to innovate, solve problems, and communicate effectively. In addition to client work, you will have the opportunity to support the growth of our US Products and Services practice's strategy and capabilities through activities related to business development, capability development, and marketing. &nbsp;

So, what are we looking for?

We are looking for motivated students interested in Products and Services industries, who are curious about helping companies evolve in today’s AI-led market. This would include exploring questions around business transformation, technological advancement, evolving consumer behaviors, and sustainable business practices. As part of the continued growth and development of our consulting services, we’re seeking individuals with skills or interests the following areas: &nbsp;

• Supply Chain Agility and Transformation &nbsp;

• AI-Centric&nbsp;Business Transformation &nbsp;

• Growth and Commercial&nbsp;Strategy &nbsp;

• Telco +&nbsp;TechCo&nbsp;Convergence &nbsp;

• Digital Media Monetization &nbsp;

• Next-Gen Digital Infrastructure &nbsp;

• Sustainability and ESG &nbsp;

&nbsp; What's in it for you? &nbsp;

• We invest in&nbsp;you,&nbsp;to ensure you&nbsp;remain&nbsp;the best in the business, through formal training,&nbsp;coaching&nbsp;and mentoring. &nbsp;

• You can talk to anyone in&nbsp;the business. There are no barriers and everyone is accessible, from our Analysts to our Partners. &nbsp;

• Opportunity to work closely with senior stakeholders both within Baringa and with the client. &nbsp;

• Exposure to a broad range of&nbsp;Products and Services&nbsp;clients across North America &nbsp;

